  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "[Add] ElementOwnershipExtensions and RelationshipOwnershipExtensions move, remove and replace the owned relationships of an element and the owned related elements of a relationship (#427)\n            [Update] Derived properties and operations return null, the first candidate or the elements present when the model is incomplete or over-populated, and no longer throw because of model state (#340)\n            [Update] RedefinedByPropertyAttribute takes an isDerivedByRedefinition argument, exposed as IsDerivedByRedefinition, and its PropertyName is read-only (#424)\n            [Remove] MultiplicityViolationException, which no derivation throws any more (#340)\n            [Fix] DTO members that a subclass redefines with a derived property, such as Membership.MemberElement, MemberName, MemberShortName and Relationship.Source and Target, keep the value assigned through the interface (#424)\n            [Fix] AssignOwnership no longer adds the target a second time when an owning membership is re-assigned (#427)",
